[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "text": "...Hello"
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "text": "What would you like me to do?"
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "text": "...So it's you again."
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "text": "I know because "
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "text": "you never say a word.  "
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "text": "Reminds me of the ocean..."
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "text": "Your calm breaths... "
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "text": "like the faint sound of waves... "
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "text": "You know I used to love the beach... "
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "text": "Hmmm......"
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "text": "So what should I "
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "text": "tell you this time?  "
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "text": "Oh, it was snowing today... "
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "text": "Strange what triggers "
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "text": "our memories."
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "text": "I'll never forget."
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "text": "That night, for the first time "
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "text": "in 120 years,"
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "text": "snow fell on Santa Destroy."
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "text": "It was a sign..."
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "text": "Another change, both beautiful "
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "text": "and deadly, was coming... "
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "text": "Blanketed in white, the city never "
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "text": "looked so beautiful."
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "text": "But anything so pristine "
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "text": "must be cursed... "
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "text": "White turned to red... "
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "text": "And he lost his mind."
  }
]